        "line": 184,
        "text": "eval (P) (u : ι → D → ℝ) : D → ℝ := fun x => P.constant x + evalTerms u P.terms x, where evalTerms u ((c,e) :: es) x = c x * e.eval _ u x + evalTerms u es x"
